  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to strengthen UN peace operations 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to strengthen UN peace operations - to  strengthen their capacity to implement complex mandates in challenging security and political circumstances - 1) Addressing mis- and disinformation, 2) Support to gender responsive UN police activities, 3) Implement and mainstream the child protection mandate, 4) Sustaining a comprehensive training architecture on child protection for the UN military and police, 5) Advancing the implementation of the Conflict-Related Sexual Violence mandate, 6) Support for the development of thematic manuals under the Strategic Guidance Framework for International Policing.</narrative>
  </description>
